<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view>每一步，</view><view>都有进度。</view></view><view class="row"><text class="sub">我的需求与订单</text><text class="link" bindtap="login">账户</text></view><view class="demo" wx:if="{{source==='demo'}}">本地演示记录 · 与真实账户隔离</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{pending}}"><view>上次提交结果待核对</view><button bindtap="reconcile">核对原提交</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">按原键原正文重试</button></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{cases}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.status_label}}</text></view><view class="sub line">{{item.description}}</view><text class="muted small">版本 {{item.version}} · 查看详情 →</text></view><view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!cases.length}}"><view class="title">暂无需求</view><view class="sub line">提交后可在此查看报价、材料与交付。</view><button bindtap="reload">重新加载</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="reload">刷新进度</button></view>
